# Mintlify automatically ignores these files and directories:
# .git, .github, .claude, .agents, .idea, node_modules,
# README.md, LICENSE.md, CHANGELOG.md, CONTRIBUTING.md

# GitHub-only governed repository surfaces. These are intentionally rendered
# for GitHub Markdown and retain PentaRelease HTML managed-block markers;
# PentaDocs has canonical native pages under pentarelease/*.mdx instead.
ABOUT_ME.md
CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
FAQ.md
PARTNERS.md

# Draft content
drafts/
*.draft.mdx
